			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 20, DX 10, IQ 4, HT 13, HP 20, WILL 9, PER 7, FP 13, SPEED 5.75, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nUma0dZW9BAyyfb-s",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 20 (offense 8, protection 12), threat tier minor, appearing 2."
		},
		{
			"id": "ntl0kg1_MGIxTQVMd",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/mule.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nKRbbvdMo0sVzF26y",
			"text": "Independent build total: -28 points of racial traits plus 1 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nemR2qj0edbMrK-KY",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Mule (SRD 5.1); Mule (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nqLK1r3TE2Bo9pgl5",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nw3rABkWOqt-hOeZR",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5 (primary). The published Move folds this creature's Enhanced Move into a single figure."
		},
		{
			"id": "nvwERK1QS5PmgrP3p",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nwmNFjGekcPwLNfMt",
			"text": "Added after a post-hoc comparison against independent GURPS fan conversions of this creature: Peripheral Vision. The comparison surfaced the gap; the build is still ours."
		},
